          <td><span class="postbody">Ok guys, we're trying to make up our mind on what we are going to play once and for all. We can obviously group together with evil and good characters, but it will make things a bit more difficult until we get to a point of being able to travel quickly (If that will be possible).
<br />

<br />
So, I would like to know what everyone would like to play, alignment and class as well.
<br />

<br />
Currently I am either going to play a Wood Elf Bard (good) or a Enchanter (either good or evil, doesn't matter to me).
<br />

<br />
More then likely I will play the enchanter in group and the wood elf as an alt.
<br />

<br />
I'm looking forward to seeing you guys again. <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="Smile" border="0" /></span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
